    "version": "1",
    "description": "Species-level identified soil animal taxa from 32 core plots from the first EFForTS phase (mostly 2013). Samples were collected from litter and soil and extracted using a Kempson extractor. The following taxonomic groups were identified to species level and are shared in this dataset: Oribatida, Mesostigmata, Collembola, Pseudoscorpiones, Chilopoda, Carabidae, Araneae (hear extraction), Araneae (litter sieving, B01 data). Morphospecies can be found in Ecotaxonomy web database.",
    "keywords": [
        "Earth and Environmental Sciences",
        "soil fauna",
        "soil biodiversity",
        "land use",
        "tropics"
    ],
